erjemahkan LENGKAP dari awal sampai akhir bagian bab ini.\\n6. JANGAN berikan teks basa-basi pembuka atau penutup (seperti 'Berikut terjemahannya', dll). Langsung isi cerita.\\\"\\\"\\\"\\n\\ndef clean_html_to_text(html_content):\\n    # remove head, style, script\\n    text = re.sub(r'<head.*?</head>', '', html_content, flags=re.DOTALL | re.IGNORECASE)\\n    text = re.sub(r'<style.*?</style>', '', text, flags=re.DOTALL | re.IGNORE\n<truncated 4733 bytes>","Path":"\"C:\\\\Users\\\\Eevyx\\\\.gemini\\\\antigravity\\\\brain\\\\dfaefe40-f699-4276-8717-cb4f8030016c\\\\scratch\\\\run_expanse_pipeline.py\""}}],"truncated_fields":["tool_calls"]}
